    "Greater arm: less(originalnode+C,pair). On true capture CURRENT head, reset mutable hintOWNER then NODE, initialize private end NODE before OWNER, actual successor then equality on real8B carriers. Read CURRENT successor AFTER equality even when equality is true; retain it across a reached less(pair,successor+C). If accepted, CURRENT originalnode.right.nil29 chooses direction0/originalnode or direction1/SAVEDsuccessor.",
    "All seven FBC0 fast paths ignore childEAX and return their retained actual output. No extra private flag-upper-word input, entry-preimage promise or aggregate iterator snapshot is added.",
    "Fallback passes real uninitialized12B private result to whole unique with same actual context/cells/callees. Consume actual returned pointer: load childOWNER -> read CURRENT private output -> store OWNER -> freshly read childNODE -> store NODE. Ignore insertedBYTE/three padding bytes. Aliasing and transitive child/provider writes are inherited.",
